{"3775190": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Goblin Adventure: Free from Lore", "steam_appid": 3775190, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧌 Goblin Adventure: Free from Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short RPG where a goblin just wants to go home.</strong><br>No side quests. No map. Lore is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mushrooms, argue with a mage, and maybe fall in love.<br>You don’t have to understand what’s happening.<br>But you can.<br>Or you can just open the portal and leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪄 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurdist fantasy RPG (~10–15 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical dialogues (but, like… chill)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss who quotes theory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goblin who doesn’t care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-irony, love, and a trans gnome</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 For players who:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are tired of 100-hour RPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just want a bit of mushroom-based meaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aren’t afraid to answer “Probably yes” to philosophical threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 You don’t have to get it.<br>You’re just a goblin.<br>And that’s enough.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧌 Goblin Adventure: Free from Lore</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A short RPG where a goblin just wants to go home.</strong><br>No side quests. No map. Lore is optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather mushrooms, argue with a mage, and maybe fall in love.<br>You don’t have to understand what’s happening.<br>But you can.<br>Or you can just open the portal and leave.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🪄 Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Absurdist fantasy RPG (~10–15 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Philosophical dialogues (but, like… chill)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A boss who quotes theory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A goblin who doesn’t care</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Post-irony, love, and a trans gnome</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎮 For players who:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >are tired of 100-hour RPGs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >just want a bit of mushroom-based meaning</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >aren’t afraid to answer “Probably yes” to philosophical threats</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 You don’t have to get it.<br>You’re just a goblin.<br>And that’s enough.</p>", "short_description": "A short and absurd goblin RPG about portals, mushrooms, and post-ironic freedom. Challenge a mage obsessed with order, or just dance in the mud. It's your lore now.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775190/e9e16b84dc3f4bdca4985bf6205abd14adc46fc8/header.jpg?t=1766966291", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775190/9f4894af9aaefb97f77a44eae5bdb8d4f946adf8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766966291", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3775190/9f4894af9aaefb97f77a44eae5bdb8d4f946adf8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766966291", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7/8/10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3 / AMD FX-4300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 / AMD HD 7870<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</